<main class="container">
    <h2>About Our School</h2>

    <p>
        Greenfield Junior School is a fictional learning institution
        dedicated to providing quality education to young learners.
        We aim to develop knowledgeable, responsible and confident
        pupils who can contribute positively to society.
    </p>

    <h3>Our Mission</h3>
    <p>
        To provide quality, inclusive and learner-centred education
        that develops pupils academically, socially and morally.
    </p>

    <h3>Our Vision</h3>
    <p>
        To become a leading junior school that nurtures responsible,
        creative and lifelong learners.
    </p>

    <h3>Our Core Values</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Discipline and responsibility</li>
        <li>Honesty and integrity</li>
        <li>Respect for others</li>
        <li>Teamwork and cooperation</li>
        <li>Creativity and innovation</li>
        <li>Excellence in learning</li>
    </ul>
</main>

